{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rumbly\u00a0is a fast-paced turn-based roguelike battle game all about speed, accuracy and creating powerful synergies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Blackeyeidle.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On Player Turn</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time your attacks for extra damage and fever bonus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fever Mode boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you are, the more actions you can take!!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use active skills to setup or defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/fever.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On Enemy Turn</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy\u2019s turn? Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/enemy.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless possibilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 5 floors, you'll receive a Blessing Buff that makes you stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every blessing buff comes with its own set condition bonus, allowing you to customize your build freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike progression ensures a dynamic and  replayable experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/blessing.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock special reward\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612210?t=1743229015","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612210?t=1743229015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/ac7dd8305c3e098b4fb108193745ed07deec62d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743229015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/ac7dd8305c3e098b4fb108193745ed07deec62d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743229015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rumbly\u00a0is a fast-paced turn-based roguelike battle game all about speed, accuracy and creating powerful synergies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Blackeyeidle.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On Player Turn</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time your attacks for extra damage and fever bonus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fever Mode boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you are, the more actions you can take!!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use active skills to setup or defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/fever.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On Enemy Turn</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy\u2019s turn? Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/enemy.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless possibilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 5 floors, you'll receive a Blessing Buff that makes you stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every blessing buff comes with its own set condition bonus, allowing you to customize your build freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike progression ensures a dynamic and  replayable experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/blessing.gif?t=1743229015\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock special reward\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["SeedGameStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descri